{%- comment -%}
  Per-product FAQs, driven by `product.metafields.custom.faqs`.

  Filled at import time so each product answers its own near-stop objections
  (sizing, what shoes it fits, shipping, returns) with no theme edits.

  Expected metafield format — rich text or multi-line text, one Q/A per line
  using a pipe:

      Which size should I order?|Order your usual shoe size. Size up if you...
      Will it fit my shoes?|It sits inside most closed shoes.

  A line with no pipe is treated as a question with no answer and skipped, so a
  half-filled metafield can never render a broken row.

  Falls back to the template's own `collapsible_tab` blocks when the metafield is
  empty, which is why generic FAQs still appear on every product.

  COMPLIANCE: answers are factual — sizing, materials, policies. No health
  outcomes. See COMPLIANCE.md.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} the main-product block
  - product: {Object}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign raw = ''
  if product.metafields.custom.faqs != blank
    assign raw = product.metafields.custom.faqs | metafield_text | strip
  endif
-%}

{%- if raw != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    newline_to_br is the standard way to split on newlines in Liquid; a literal
    newline inside a quoted string is not parseable.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign faq_lines = raw | replace: '</li>', '|~L|' | strip_html | newline_to_br | replace: '<br />', '|~L|' | replace: '<br>', '|~L|' | split: '|~L|' -%}

  {%- liquid
    assign valid = 0
    for line in faq_lines
      if line contains '|'
        assign valid = valid | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  -%}

  {%- if valid > 0 -%}
    <div class="sw-product-faqs" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <p class="sw-offer__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- for line in faq_lines -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign trimmed = line | strip
          unless trimmed contains '|'
            continue
          endunless
          assign parts = trimmed | split: '|'
          assign question = parts[0] | strip
          assign answer = parts[1] | strip
        -%}
        {%- if question != blank and answer != blank -%}
          <details class="sw-faq" id="Sw-Faq-{{ block.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}">
            <summary class="sw-faq__summary">
              <span class="sw-faq__question">{{ question }}</span>
              <span class="sw-faq__marker" aria-hidden="true">
                {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sw-faq__answer rte">{{ answer }}</div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
